# Build context filter for the root-context images:
#   - deploy/images/rtcd.Dockerfile  (rtcd/go.mod replaces -> ../server)
#   - server/Dockerfile              (server/go.mod replaces -> ../rtcd)
# Both are built from the REPO ROOT because each module has a local replace
# directive pointing at the other.
#
# Only server/ + rtcd/ + deploy/images/ are needed; everything else would
# just bloat the context upload (frontend node_modules, .git, reports…).

*
!server/
!server/**
!rtcd/
!rtcd/**
!deploy/images/
!deploy/images/**

# Within the allowed trees, still exclude build/test debris.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/*.test
**/dist/
**/coverage/
